  "text": "### Step 4: Response (Day 8 Latest)  \n**Written Response Must Include:**\n- Acknowledgment of complaint\n- Summary of investigation\n- Clear decision and reasoning\n- Compensation offered (if applicable)\n- Explanation of right to escalate  \n**Delivery:**\n- Email or letter (customer choice)\n- Plain language (avoid jargon)\n- Tone: Professional, respectful  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 13/36",
  "_domain": "banking.policy",
